{
  "version": 1,
  "offsetUnit": "utf16",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "historical-plain",
      "format": "plain",
      "source": "# 旧笔记 **照原样**",
      "visible": [
        "# 旧笔记 **照原样**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "basic",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "# 标题\n\n正文 **加粗**、*斜体*、~~删除~~。\n下一行\n\n> 引用",
      "visible": [
        "标题",
        "正文",
        "加粗",
        "斜体",
        "删除",
        "下一行",
        "引用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gfm",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "- [ ] 未完成\n- [x] 已完成\n\n| 名称 | 数量 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 苹果 | 2 |",
      "visible": [
        "未完成",
        "已完成",
        "名称",
        "数量",
        "苹果",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "literal-code",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "`#代码 @阿明`\n\n```text\n    indented #代码\n```",
      "visible": [
        "#代码 @阿明",
        "    indented #代码"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unsupported",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "<b>保留 HTML</b>\n\n![图片](https://example.com/a.png) 后面的文字\n\n$公式$",
      "visible": [
        "<b>保留 HTML</b>",
        "![图片](https://example.com/a.png)",
        "后面的文字",
        "$公式$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unicode-mention",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "😀 **中文** @阿明 #工作",
      "visible": [
        "😀",
        "中文",
        "@阿明",
        "#工作"
      ],
      "mentions": [
        {
          "start_index": 10,
          "length": 3,
          "display_name": "阿明"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "escaped-literal",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "\\# 旧标题 \\*\\*普通文字\\*\\*",
      "visible": [
        "# 旧标题 **普通文字**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "malformed-image",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "还没写完 ![图片",
      "visible": [
        "还没写完 ![图片"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "escaped-tag-punctuation",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "#a\\*b #a\\_b #a\\\\b #a&amp;b #版本&#x1F680;",
      "visible": [
        "#a*b",
        "#a_b",
        "#a\\b",
        "#a&b",
        "#版本🚀"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "a*b",
        "a_b",
        "a\\b",
        "a&b",
        "版本🚀"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "protected-business-contexts",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "\\#literal &#35;entity [**#链接**](https://example.com) https://example.com/#fragment `#code` ![#image](https://example.com/a.png)",
      "visible": [
        "#literal",
        "#entity",
        "#链接",
        "#fragment",
        "#code",
        "![#image](https://example.com/a.png)"
      ],
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "literal-html-blocks",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "<b>保留 HTML</b>\n\n<div>块级 #HTML **原文**</div>\n\n<script>alert(1)</script>",
      "visible": [
        "<b>保留 HTML</b>",
        "<div>块级 #HTML **原文**</div>",
        "<script>alert(1)</script>"
      ],
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "id": "formatted-tags",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "# 标题 **#工作**\n\n- __＃重点__\n\n| 标签 |\n| --- |\n| #版本🚀 |",
      "visible": [
        "#工作",
        "＃重点",
        "#版本🚀"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "工作",
        "重点",
        "版本🚀"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "literal-inline-html",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "前 <span title=\"#属性\">正文</span> <!-- #注释 --> #标签",
      "visible": [
        "<span title=\"#属性\">正文</span>",
        "<!-- #注释 -->",
        "#标签"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "标签"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inline-spaces-before-tag",
      "format": "markdown",
      "source": "**甲**    #工作",
      "visible": [
        "甲",
        "#工作"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "工作"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
